      ],
      "text": "Core components include a Tree-sitter-based AST/semantic knowledge graph in Neo4j, LangGraph state machines with checkpointing, Docker containers for isolated build/test execution, and multi-tier LLM integration (GPT-4, Claude, Gemini)."
    },
